cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FontVibe Copy-and-Paste Symbols"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "FontVibe"
    website: "https://fontvibe.ai"
abstract: >-
  The copy-and-paste symbol library behind fontvibe.ai: hearts, heart combos,
  stars, arrows, brackets, math, currency and other symbol categories, with
  each category named in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Japanese and
  Chinese, and every code point annotated with its Unicode 16.0 name, general
  category, block, age and emoji properties. Kaomoji are published separately.
keywords:
  - symbols
  - unicode
  - copy-paste
  - text symbols
  - heart symbol
  - emoji
  - dataset
  - multilingual
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://fontvibe.ai/tools/heart-symbol"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Funovate-Technology/fontvibe-symbols"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
